Response:
{% comment %} The first key is the party size, the second the time slot. {% endcomment %}
{% assign party = Digits | slice: 0 | plus: 0 %}
{% assign slot = Digits | slice: 1 %}
{% case slot %}
  {% when "1" %}{% assign time = "6 p.m." %}
  {% when "2" %}{% assign time = "7 p.m." %}
  {% when "3" %}{% assign time = "8 p.m." %}
{% endcase %}

{% if party == 9 %}
  Monk's Café seats parties of up to eight. No table for you!


{% elsif party < 1 or time == blank %}
  Sorry, that is not a reservation we can take. Please call again.


{% else %}
  A table for {{ party }} at {{ time }} tonight. We are sending you a text message to confirm.


  Monk's Café: your table for {{ party }} is booked for {{ time }} tonight. Call us if your plans change.


  New reservation: {{ party }} at {{ time }} tonight, for {{ From }}.

  Thank you for calling Monk's Café. Goodbye.

{% endif %}
